--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Method: a zero is only worth what its control is worth. To prove the zero in
  STEP 3 was VRF isolation and not a broken port, a dead cable, an STP block or a
  lost ARP, BOTH interfaces are put in the SAME VRF and the identical frames sent
  again -- with nothing else whatsoever changed.

  First, an attempt that was refused, at 23:26:41:
